---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '@/lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
  description={`How ${SITE_NAME} handles your data, cookies and analytics.`}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface sm:text-3xl">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
      Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">1. Overview</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          {SITE_NAME} runs entirely in your browser. The calculators on this site compute locally on
          your device — the numbers you enter are not sent to, or stored on, any server. That means
          your calculations stay private by design.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">2. What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          We do not require an account, and we never ask for personal information such as your name,
          email address or phone number to use any calculator.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          We do process anonymous, aggregated usage data to understand how the site is used and to
          improve it. This data does not identify you personally.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">3. Analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          We use Google Analytics to measure page views and on-site interactions, such as which
          calculators are used. Google Analytics uses cookies and collects a pseudonymous identifier
          for your device, plus technical information such as browser type and approximate location.
          This helps us understand which content is useful and where to focus improvements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">4. Cookies &amp; consent</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          When you first visit the site, we show a consent banner. Your choice is stored locally in
          your browser (via <code class="rounded bg-md-surface-container px-1 py-0.5">localStorage</code>)
          so we remember it on your next visit. You can change or clear this choice at any time from
          your browser's settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">5. Advertising</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          Where advertising is shown, ads load only after you accept the consent prompt. Advertising
          partners may use cookies to show relevant ads and to measure ad performance. No ads load if
          you decline consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">6. Third-party links</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          Pages may link to external websites (for example, related tools or informational resources).
          We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites, and we encourage you to
          review their policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">7. Your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          You can decline analytics and advertising at any time by refusing or withdrawing consent in
          the consent prompt, or by clearing cookies and site data in your browser. Where required by
          law, you also have the right to access, correct or delete any personal data we hold about
          you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">8. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          We may update this policy from time to time. Changes take effect when they are published on
          this page, and the "last updated" date above reflects the latest revision.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-md-on-surface">9. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant">
          If you have questions about this policy, you can reach us at the contact details listed on
          the site.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
